WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:02.020
- Have you ever tried to reheat fast food?

00:00:02.020 --> 00:00:04.910
I find myself always chasing
that level of deliciousness,

00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:07.100
that like "chomp, chomp,
chomp" right when you get it.

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:08.970
It's so good every single time.

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:11.360
Fast food fries are
just one of those foods

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:13.920
that is just superior to most things.

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:14.753
So for this video,

00:00:14.753 --> 00:00:16.360
I'm going to be testing
all the ways I can think of

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:17.610
to reheat fast food,

00:00:17.610 --> 00:00:21.310
to get as close as I can to
being as good as possible.

00:00:21.310 --> 00:00:24.120
We're going to focus on two
staples, burger and fries.

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:27.403
We got to put all of these
burgers in the fridge.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:29.916
(boxes falling)

00:00:29.916 --> 00:00:31.160
(oh no!)

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:33.808
I almost forgot about our sack of fries.

00:00:33.808 --> 00:00:34.700
(bag crinkling)

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:35.890
Through the magic of editing,

00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:37.960
we are ready to start.

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:38.940
I don't know why I did that.

00:00:38.940 --> 00:00:40.330
This is going to give us a good sense

00:00:40.330 --> 00:00:43.570
of where our starting line
for each test is going to be.

00:00:43.570 --> 00:00:45.150
The fact that I can grip the top bun

00:00:45.150 --> 00:00:46.810
and everything just kind of stays.

00:00:46.810 --> 00:00:48.082
Like I really think.

00:00:48.082 --> 00:00:49.670
(gasping)

00:00:49.670 --> 00:00:50.850
- Cold fries, not good.

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:52.810
Cross section here.

00:00:52.810 --> 00:00:57.250
With our question, the
simplest reheating technique,

00:00:57.250 --> 00:00:58.097
we're talking microwave.

00:00:58.097 --> 00:00:58.930
Go here.

00:00:58.930 --> 00:01:00.370
(cheering)

00:01:00.370 --> 00:01:01.736
- Burger here.

00:01:01.736 --> 00:01:02.650
(microwave door closing)

00:01:02.650 --> 00:01:04.500
- I'm going to start with a minute

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:06.370
and then just kind of
eyeball it from there.

00:01:06.370 --> 00:01:09.960
"Sitting on the floor in
front of the microwave."

00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:11.580
Even though it's only been 20 seconds,

00:01:11.580 --> 00:01:13.810
I am smelling a lot of,

00:01:13.810 --> 00:01:17.157
let's go 10 more seconds.

00:01:17.157 --> 00:01:18.150
(go, go, go)

00:01:18.150 --> 00:01:20.100
- All right. That's enough.

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:21.500
The bun is very hot.

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:25.900
The fries are very hot, but I
don't like what I'm feeling.

00:01:25.900 --> 00:01:27.070
It's been less than a minute.

00:01:27.070 --> 00:01:28.390
It smells like fast food.

00:01:28.390 --> 00:01:31.473
I can feel the heat, like
radiating off of this.

00:01:32.800 --> 00:01:34.740
Microwave. Come on!

00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:36.260
It's the right temperature

00:01:36.260 --> 00:01:38.600
of what you want a french fry to be,

00:01:38.600 --> 00:01:40.390
but it is so limp.

00:01:40.390 --> 00:01:41.400
I expected that.

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:43.700
And I don't know if there's a
way to really get around that

00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:45.273
from a microwave, but.

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:48.240
The burger, I have a little
more faith in, honestly.

00:01:48.240 --> 00:01:49.673
It's so hot!

00:01:49.673 --> 00:01:51.840
(gasping)

00:01:52.930 --> 00:01:54.620
- Shocking, electrifying.

00:01:54.620 --> 00:01:56.260
The bun has lost a lot.

00:01:56.260 --> 00:01:58.480
It's basically the same
texture as the burger.

00:01:58.480 --> 00:01:59.313
Guys, what are we going to do?

00:01:59.313 --> 00:02:02.240
I am sweating so bad.

00:02:02.240 --> 00:02:05.020
There's a lot of things
going right for microwave,

00:02:05.020 --> 00:02:07.080
that took literally no time at all.

00:02:07.080 --> 00:02:09.280
And the burger patty is pretty ideal.

00:02:09.280 --> 00:02:13.470
The microwave burger gets, I got to go 7.

00:02:13.470 --> 00:02:15.990
I'm thinking what the end
of this video should be

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:18.870
