00:02:58.810 --> 00:03:01.820
There's a good crisp. The
cheese is melty again.

00:03:01.820 --> 00:03:04.980
The bun is a little crispy on the outside.

00:03:04.980 --> 00:03:06.060
Hmm. Let's talk about it.

00:03:06.060 --> 00:03:09.240
It's cooked more evenly throughout

00:03:09.240 --> 00:03:10.480
than I thought it would be.

00:03:10.480 --> 00:03:13.030
Taking into consideration the
burger and fries together,

00:03:13.030 --> 00:03:15.690
out of 10, like a 7 1/2.

00:03:15.690 --> 00:03:16.910
It's really strong.

00:03:16.910 --> 00:03:19.920
Time to bust out some pans.

00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:21.470
I think for our pan method,

00:03:21.470 --> 00:03:24.590
