00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:33.840
I think we just got to see what happens.

00:03:33.840 --> 00:03:36.650
I'm going to put the buns in cold.

00:03:36.650 --> 00:03:38.140
Soften up a little bit.

00:03:38.140 --> 00:03:40.440
I'll take them out before adding the patty

00:03:40.440 --> 00:03:44.390
