00:03:51.702 --> 00:03:52.970
Test. They're not cold anymore.

00:03:52.970 --> 00:03:53.990
Could be crisper.

00:03:53.990 --> 00:03:55.310
I don't want to forget about these buns.

00:03:55.310 --> 00:03:56.950
I think I'm going to pull that off.

00:03:56.950 --> 00:03:58.650
Let's go burger in.

00:03:58.650 --> 00:04:00.880
I forgot that the cheese
