00:04:23.470 --> 00:04:26.223
Everything still feels warm and hot.

00:04:29.302 --> 00:04:31.290
Hmm, that is quite nice.

00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:33.110
The button is still light and fluffy.

00:04:33.110 --> 00:04:35.360
It's not dried out like
